{
  "name": "vehiclenet-gateway",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "車輛履歷系統 Fabric Gateway REST API（Node.js/TypeScript），對應 plan.md 階段 3／5。ESM：@noble/post-quantum 僅提供 ESM 套件。",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
